om&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ5oiqCU4ZXVKPdceLx1t6c9b2FCHWqvR7Kb3eFFUL84g&oe=6AFB305D"}, {"file_name": "nomad_store_05_target_range.png", "id": "1064370423254991", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825497_1064370433254990_8300007350378005738_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CZGpeS-JSJoQ7kNvwGjVrdp&_nc_oc=Adq0O_1GA8h9ny1vv90hQ0BPxK4zqm9gqKtgevJfGeSUSxrp30Tqa_ahOIaNiMBwZJ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSR5LmoVs7aeZ0mZnt0laNo_gScW0k9PG45AXkLciJbLA&oe=6AFB2B0F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "nomad_shooter_exact_2560x1440_24bit.png", "id": "1650210489964847", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1650210496631513_7793386767145659260_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QxwPv_YkrMYQ7kNvwFb5TnM&_nc_oc=AdqXAiwKmxybgGFS74faL8JoB98xWbaiGtpIzNOgTpiQ01vsmkZmQp91j4z1jXpmcr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRqdwWibwgzGL2U2Sv5OoNi1wpJgPz4dOunJPvuIBPcUA&oe=6AFB34A7"}, "display_name": "Nomad Shooter", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "sport", "arcade", "training"], "long_description": "# Nomad Shooter\n\nA VR archery challenge that rewards a steady hand, a clean release, and the satisfaction of a true shot. Step into the role of a steppe archer and put your skill to the test.\n\n**Earn Every Shot**\n\nThere are no shortcuts to the next trial. Earn the score you need to advance, learn from every miss, and come back with better timing and a steadier hand. The further you go, the more each shot demands: judgment, patience, and the nerve to release at the right moment.\n\n**Master the Bow**\n\nTrain at your own pace or go for a cleaner run. A master archer guides you, but only you can make the shot.\n\n**Breathe. Draw. Release.**", "short_description": "Draw the bow, make a clean release, and watch your arrow fly true. In Nomad Shooter, you become a